OL,3,ASir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,4,A'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Ian McKellen and William Shatner
OL,8,Flead tributes to Sir Patrick Stewart,
OL,9,Fthe legendary Star Trek and stage actor
OL,10,Fwho has died aged 86
OL,12,FSir Ian describes Sir Patrick as a "man
OL,13,Fto rely on, to admire and in my case,
OL,14,Flove"
OL,16,FShatner says the actor "stood for the
OL,17,Fbest of us", while another fellow Star
OL,18,FTrek cast member George Takei calls him
OL,19,Fan "irreplaceable legend"
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/20
