OL,3,ASir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,4,A'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FStewart died at his home in Los Angeles
OL,8,Fon Wednesday after a "brief and
OL,9,Fpoignant journey" with Alzheimer's and
OL,10,FLewy Body Dementia, according to a
OL,11,Fstatement
OL,13,FHis appeal crossed generations, and
OL,14,Fyounger fans would have discovered his
OL,15,Fwork on streaming platforms, writes our
OL,16,Fculture correspondent Noor Nanji
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/20
